204
00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:43.580
Selanjutnya di Mobile Suit Gundam SEED.

205
00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:44.690
Untuk Payback!

206
00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:48.310
Dengan pukulan kritis, potong Gundam!
